SCOPE OF THIS LICENSE

The MIT terms above cover the source code in this repository (`src/`,
`scripts/`, `tests/`, `portfolio/`) and the derived result tables and figures in
`results/`.

They do NOT cover the following, which carry their own terms:

1. Inside Airbnb data
   `data/` contains listings data derived from the Inside Airbnb Toronto
   snapshot (November 2025). Inside Airbnb publishes its data under a
   Creative Commons CC0 1.0 Universal dedication, but the underlying listing
   content originates from Airbnb. Review the terms at
   https://insideairbnb.com/data-policies/ before redistributing the raw or
   cleaned CSVs.

2. Course report PDF
   `portfolio/public/report/EECS4414-Airbnb-Network-Analysis-Final-Report.pdf`
   is a York University EECS 4414 course submission. It is included for
   portfolio display only. It is not licensed for reuse, modification, or
   redistribution, and it must not be submitted as anyone else's academic work.

3. Third-party dependencies
   Python and Node dependencies retain their own licenses. See
   `requirements-lock.txt` and `portfolio/pnpm-lock.yaml`.
